<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n53845" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κατᾰγωγ-ός</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">όν</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>seductive</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Σειρήνων μέλος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>AP</u>
					15.12
				</span></i>
			 (<i><span class="en">
				Leo Phil.
			</span></i>). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>lowering</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ψυχῆς</span>, opp.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀναγωγός</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Iamb.
				<u>Myst.</u>
				3.25
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ κ. ἔθνος τῶν δαιμόνων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Procl.
					<u>in Alc.</u>
					p.45
				</span></i>
			 C.; <i>debasing</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">παθήματα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Iamb.
					<u>VP</u>
					32.228
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Hierocl.
				<u>in CA</u>
				24p.472M.
			</span></i>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κατωφερής</span>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Iamb.
				<u>Myst.</u>
				5.11
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>fit for ships to put in at</i>, of a harbour, Sch.<i><span class="en">
				Il.
				2.494
			</span></i>.</div>
